<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>AAI platform console</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/console.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="concept-body">
    <div class="concept-shell">
      <aside class="concept-rail">
        <div class="concept-brand"><span class="concept-brand__mark">A</span><strong>AAI Platform</strong></div>
        <nav aria-label="Platform console">
          <a class="concept-nav concept-nav--active" href="/">Home</a>
          <a class="concept-nav" href="/track/local-first">Learn</a>
          <a class="concept-nav" href="/track/generate">Start a project</a>
          <a class="concept-nav" href="#readiness">Readiness</a>
          <a class="concept-nav" href="/track/build">Build</a>
          <a class="concept-nav" href="/track/evaluate">Evaluate &amp; cost</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="concept-rail__foot"><span class="concept-status"></span> Platform available</div>
      </aside>

      <main class="concept-main">
        <header class="concept-topbar">
          <span>Developer launchpad</span>
          <div><a class="concept-linkbtn" href="/track/connect#step-doctor">Help</a><span class="chip {% if session.hosted %}chip--live{% endif %}">{% if session.hosted %}Hosted{% else %}Local{% endif %}</span></div>
        </header>

        <div class="concept-content">
          <section class="concept-screen" id="welcome">
            <div class="concept-eyebrow">WELCOME TO THE AAI PLATFORM</div>
            <h1>What would you like to do?</h1>
            <p class="concept-lede">Start small. We will show you only what you need for the next successful step.</p>
            <div class="concept-actions">
              <article class="concept-action concept-action--primary">
                <span class="concept-action__icon">→</span>
                <div><h2>Take the 10-minute orientation</h2><p>Run one example, connect safely, and find your first trace.</p></div>
                <a class="concept-button" href="/track/local-first">Start orientation</a>
              </article>
              <article class="concept-action"><span class="concept-action__icon">＋</span><div><h2>Start a new project</h2><p>Choose the right supported template and generate the setup command.</p></div><a class="concept-button" href="/track/generate">Choose a template</a></article>
              <article class="concept-action"><span class="concept-action__icon">✓</span><div><h2>Check my readiness</h2><p>Separate workstation, personal access, and platform service checks.</p></div><a class="concept-button" href="#readiness">View readiness</a></article>
            </div>
            <div class="concept-return"><div><strong>Already completed the local steps?</strong><span>Continue with keyless workspace access.</span></div><a class="concept-button" href="/track/connect">Connect</a></div>
          </section>

          <section class="concept-screen" id="first-success">
            <div class="concept-stephead"><div><div class="concept-eyebrow">MILESTONE 1 OF 4</div><h1>Find your first trace</h1><p>One guided success before we introduce projects, governance, or deployment.</p></div><span class="concept-time">~ 10 min</span></div>
            <div class="concept-progress"><span class="is-done"></span><span class="is-done"></span><span class="is-current"></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="concept-tour">
              <article class="concept-guide">
                <span class="concept-kicker">STEP 3 OF 4</span><h2>Open the trace in MLflow</h2>
                <p>Your workspace example wrote a trace. In Databricks, open <strong>Experiments</strong>, select your application experiment, then open the latest trace.</p>
                <div class="concept-note"><strong>Why this matters</strong><br />A trace shows what the application did, how long it took, and the evidence you will evaluate later.</div>
                <div class="concept-buttons"><a class="concept-primarybtn" href="/track/connect#step-workspace-connect">Run the workspace example</a><a class="concept-secondarybtn" href="/track/generate">I found it</a></div>
              </article>
              <figure class="concept-shot">
                <figcaption>Illustrative Databricks orientation</figcaption>
                <div class="mock-db">
                  <div class="mock-db__rail"><b>◆</b><i></i><i class="active"></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                  <div class="mock-db__body"><div class="mock-db__top">Experiments <span>Search</span></div><div class="mock-db__crumb">Workspace / AAI / first-trace</div><h3>first-trace</h3><div class="mock-tabs">Runs <b>Traces</b> Models</div><div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-check"></span><strong>latest workspace trace</strong><em>success</em><small>1.24s</small></div><div class="mock-callout">1 <span>Open the latest trace</span></div></div>
                </div>
                <p>Screenshot uses synthetic data. Navigation labels may change.</p>
              </figure>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="concept-screen" id="project">
            <div class="concept-eyebrow">MILESTONE 2 OF 4</div><h1>Start with the right project</h1><p class="concept-lede">Answer two questions. We will recommend a starting point without making you learn every architecture.</p>
            <div class="concept-question"><span>1</span><div><h2>What are you trying to do?</h2><div class="concept-pills"><a href="/track/generate#step-decide">Build an application</a><a href="/track/generate#step-decide">Evaluate something existing</a><a href="/track/local-first">Explore an idea</a></div></div></div>
            <div class="concept-question"><span>2</span><div><h2>Need help choosing?</h2><p>Compare the five supported starting points by outcome before generating anything.</p></div></div>
            <article class="concept-recommend"><div><span>NEXT STEP</span><h2>Compare supported templates</h2><p>Choose experiments, prompts, evaluation, RAG, or agents from one guided page.</p><div class="concept-tags"><b>Ownership defaults</b><b>Evaluation included</b><b>Approved compute</b></div></div><div class="concept-recommend__actions"><a class="concept-primarybtn" href="/track/generate#step-decide">Compare templates</a></div></article>
          </section>

          <section class="concept-screen" id="readiness">
            <div class="concept-eyebrow">BEFORE YOUR FIRST CLOUD RUN</div><h1>Know what is ready—and who can fix what is not</h1><p class="concept-lede">These are separate checks. Platform health never claims to represent your personal permissions.</p>
            <div class="concept-readygrid">
              <article><header><span class="ready-icon">1</span><div><h2>Workstation</h2><p>Your local tools</p></div></header><strong class="ready-state">Check locally</strong><ul><li>Python 3.11 or 3.12</li><li>Azure CLI</li><li>Databricks CLI</li></ul><a class="concept-button" href="/track/prerequisites#step-workstation">View checklist</a></article>
              <article><header><span class="ready-icon">2</span><div><h2>Personal access</h2><p>Your group grants</p></div></header><strong class="ready-state">Verify as yourself</strong><ul><li>Workspace access</li><li>SDK volume access</li><li>Compute policy</li></ul><a class="concept-button" href="/track/setup#step-check-only">Run personal preflight</a></article>
              <article><header><span class="ready-icon">3</span><div><h2>Platform services</h2><p>App runtime checks</p></div></header><strong class="ready-state">Check app runtime</strong><ul><li>Template repository</li><li>Approved compute</li><li>SDK artifacts</li></ul><button type="button" data-run-checks>Run platform check</button></article>
            </div>
            <div id="checks-target" class="checks-target"></div>
            <div class="concept-cost"><div><span class="concept-cost__icon">$</span><div><h2>Cost basics for your first run</h2><p>Cost grows with resource size, run time, and frequency. Project context makes that usage attributable.</p></div></div><div class="concept-context"><span><small>PROJECT</small>Who funds the work?</span><span><small>OWNER GROUP</small>Who supports it?</span><span><small>ENVIRONMENT</small>Where will it run?</span><span><small>CLASSIFICATION</small>What data controls apply?</span></div><a href="/track/generate">Set these when generating a project →</a></div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <script src="/static/console.js" type="module"></script>
  </body>
</html>
